    "body": "https://cs.chromium.org/chromium/src/third_party/WebKit/Source/modules/indexeddb/IDBEventDispatcher.cpp seems like a specialized implementation of event dispatch for Indexed DB, but even there I cannot find a throwing reference. @inexorabletash? (Not reusing `EventTarget` might lead to other interesting bugs I suppose.)\r\n\r\n@smaug---- what does Gecko do here?",
